        "accession_number": "0001829126-26-002517",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-19",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "The decision as to whether we will seek shareholder approval of our proposed business combination or allow shareholders to sell their shares to us in a tender offer will be made by us, solely in our discretion, and will be based on a variety of factors such as the timing of the transaction and whether the terms of the transaction would otherwise require us to seek shareholder approval.",
        "start_character": 18378,
        "end_character": 18766
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001829126-26-002517",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001829126-26-002517-351ce093e10c4caa",
        "accession_number": "0001829126-26-002517",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-19",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Unlike other blank check companies which require shareholder votes and conduct proxy solicitations in conjunction with their initial business combinations and related conversions of public shares for cash upon consummation of such initial business combinations even when a vote is not required by law, we will have the flexibility to avoid such shareholder vote and allow our shareholders to sell their shares pursuant to the tender offer rules of the SEC.",
        "start_character": 18767,
        "end_character": 19223
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001829126-26-002517",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001829126-26-002517-351ce093e10c4caa",
        "accession_number": "0001829126-26-002517",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-19",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We are not prohibited from pursuing an initial business combination with a company that is affiliated with our Sponsor, officers or directors or non-managing Sponsor investors, or completing the business combination through a joint venture or other form of shared ownership with our Sponsor, officers or directors or non-managing Sponsor investors.",
        "start_character": 27663,
        "end_character": 28011
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001829126-26-002517",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001829126-26-002517-351ce093e10c4caa",
        "accession_number": "0001829126-26-002517",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-19",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "At various times some members of our management team have lived and worked in certain markets we are targeting, which has enabled them to create professional and social networks.",
        "start_character": 11342,
        "end_character": 11520
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001829126-26-002517",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001829126-26-002517-351ce093e10c4caa",
        "accession_number": "0001829126-26-002517",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-19",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.9,
        "statement": "However, unless we consummate our initial business combination with an affiliated entity, our Board of Directors is not required to obtain an opinion from an independent investment banking firm or another independent entity that the price we are paying is fair to our shareholders from a financial point of view.",
        "start_character": 25406,
        "end_character": 25718
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001829126-26-002517",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001829126-26-002517-351ce093e10c4caa",
        "accession_number": "0001829126-26-002517",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-19",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.9,
        "statement": "If our Board of Directors is not able independently to determine the fair market value of the target business or businesses, we may, in our sole discretion, obtain an opinion from an independent investment banking firm, or another independent entity that commonly renders valuation opinions on the type of target business we are seeking to acquire, with respect to the satisfaction of such criteria.",
        "start_character": 24495,
        "end_character": 24894
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001829126-26-002517",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001829126-26-002517-351ce093e10c4caa",
        "accession_number": "0001829126-26-002517",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-19",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.9,
        "statement": "If we are unable to complete our initial business combination within 24 months from the closing of the IPO (as may be extended by shareholder approval to amend our amended and restated memorandum and articles of association to extend the date by which we must consummate our initial business combination), or by such earlier liquidation date as our board of directors may approve, the founder shares and private units may expire worthless, except to the extent they receive liquidating distributions from assets outside the trust account, which could create an incentive for our Sponsor, executive officers and directors to complete a transaction even if we select an acquisition target that subsequently declines in value and is unprofitable for public shareholders.",
        "start_character": 29323,
        "end_character": 30090
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001829126-26-002517",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001829126-26-002517-351ce093e10c4caa",
        "accession_number": "0001829126-26-002517",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-19",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.9,
        "statement": "In addition, our Sponsor and our officers and directors may Sponsor or form other special purpose acquisition companies similar to ours or may pursue other business or investment ventures during the period in which we are seeking an initial business combination.",
        "start_character": 32067,
        "end_character": 32329
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001829126-26-002517",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001829126-26-002517-351ce093e10c4caa",
        "accession_number": "0001829126-26-002517",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-19",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.9,
        "statement": "We will seek to combine with a company with a leading position in its geography, market share, volume, technology, product capabilities, or other attributes across an industry or segment, significant barriers to entry and a sustainable competitive advantage.",
        "start_character": 15972,
        "end_character": 16230
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001829126-26-002517",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001829126-26-002517-351ce093e10c4caa",
        "accession_number": "0001829126-26-002517",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-19",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.86,
        "statement": "Additionally, we are a “smaller reporting company” as defined in Item 10(f)(1) of Regulation S-K.",
        "start_character": 38759,
        "end_character": 38856
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001829126-26-002517",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001829126-26-002517-351ce093e10c4caa",
        "accession_number": "0001829126-26-002517",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-19",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.86,
        "statement": "Additionally, we will maintain a strong emphasis on companies based in or focused on emerging and frontier markets.",
        "start_character": 785,
        "end_character": 900
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001829126-26-002517",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001829126-26-002517-351ce093e10c4caa",
        "accession_number": "0001829126-26-002517",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-19",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.86,
        "statement": "As such, we are eligible to take advantage of certain exemptions from various reporting requirements that are applicable to other public companies that are not “emerging growth companies” including, but not limited to, not being required to comply with the auditor attestation requirements of Section 404 of the Sarbanes-Oxley Act, reduced disclosure obligations regarding executive compensation in our periodic reports and proxy statements, and exemptions from the requirements of holding a non-binding advisory vote on executive compensation and shareholder approval of any golden parachute payments not previously approved.",
